<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Dalys details capitalisation award.</title>
<headline>Dalys details capitalisation award.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dalys Ltd said on Monday it would award capitalisation shares to shareholders on register on September 13.</p>
<p>The new shares would be issued in the ratio that 85 cents multiplied by 1.05 bears to the average closing price of Dalys ordinary shares on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange for the four business days ending October 17.</p>
<p>Shareholders may elect to receive an 85 cents cash dividend instead.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
